      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身為在寶可夢中心工作的人，\n我的拿手絕招是幫寶可夢回復。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我還把它傳授給了寶可夢呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB70BA57285BF653EF59224E2D5FC35DE54F5C76844EBAFF0C000A6211768462FF624B7D5562DB662F5E6B5BF653EF592256DE5FA9300200100001BE00000A62119084628A5B8350B363887D664E865BF653EF59225462FF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個絕招就是\n能夠回復寶可夢HP的招式！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B7D5562DB5C31662F000A80FD592056DE5FA95BF653EF592200480050768462DB5F0FFF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何！？要不要和我這些\n擅長回復的寶可夢們對戰看看呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF01FF1F89814E0D8981548C621190194E9B000A64C5957756DE5FA976845BF653EF592250115C0D6230770B770B5462FF1F00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要寶可夢對戰的話，\n請向我搭話喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815BF653EF59225C0D623076848A71FF0C000A8ACB54116211642D8A715594300200100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要和我這些擅長回復的\n寶可夢們對戰看看嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981548C621190194E9B64C5957756DE5FA97684000A5BF653EF592250115C0D6230770B770B55CEFF1F00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒有能打倒對手的攻擊力和自信\n就不接受挑戰，這是個明智之舉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92670980FD625350125C0D624B7684653B64CA529B548C81EA4FE1000A5C314E0D63A553D763116230FF0C9019662F500B660E667A4E4B8209300200100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請嚐嚐那種以為能擊倒對手，\n下一秒對手卻回復了的絕望滋味吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB5690569090A37A2E4EE570BA80FD64CA50125C0D624BFF0C000A4E0B4E0079D25C0D624B537B56DE5FA94E8676847D55671B6ECB54735427FF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "壓倒性的攻擊力！\n足以構成威脅的持久耐力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "58D3501260277684653B64CA529BFF01000A8DB34EE569CB62105A018105768463014E458010529BFF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只靠回復是不足以獲勝的。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我明明是知道這一點，\n還慎選了招式，卻……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA976056DE5FA9662F4E0D8DB34EE5737252DD7684300200100001BE01000A6211660E660E662F77E5905390194E009EDEFF0C000A9084614E90784E8662DB5F0FFF0C537B2026202600100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我承認<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的強大……\n以及我的不足。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211627F8A8D00100003110000FF01014F6059B376845F37592720262026000A4EE553CA621176844E0D8DB3300200100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但再怎麼說，\n我都是寶可夢中心的人！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n拿手絕招是幫寶可夢回復！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46518D600E9EBC8AAAFF0C000A621190FD662F5BF653EF59224E2D5FC376844EBAFF0100100001BE00000A62FF624B7D5562DB662F5E6B5BF653EF592256DE5FA9FF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，我來幫受傷的寶可夢\n恢復活力吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C62114F865E6B53D750B776845BF653EF5922000A60625FA96D3B529B5427FF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然說自己動手幫自己寄放的\n寶可夢回復，這感覺有點怪怪的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671368AAA81EA5DF152D5624B5E6B81EA5DF15BC4653E7684000A5BF653EF592256DE5FA9FF0C9019611F89BA67099EDE602A602A7684300200100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我交給我們的光電傘蜥牠們\n全部都恢復活力囉！呵呵！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EA47D66621150117684514996FB5098872572605011000A516890E890FD60625FA96D3B529B56C9FF0154755475FF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來到這裡，\n我隨時都會幫<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的寶可夢恢復活力喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
